title: UAC Bypass via eventvwr.exe Registry Hijack
id: d57998bf-552f-4d78-8b25-91d7df47df89
status: experimental
description: Detects eventvwr UAC bypass.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/002/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: registry_set
detection:
  selection:
    TargetObject|contains: '\Software\Classes\mscfile\shell\open\command'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - TargetObject
  - Details
  - Image
falsepositives:
  - Rare legitimate handler customization
level: high
tags:
  - attack.privilege_escalation
  - attack.t1548.002
